%N A399284 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} AO(2*k-1)/(2*k-1)^2, where AO(k) = A007509(k)/A352395(k) is the k-th alternating odd harmonic number (or skew-harmonic number of the second kind).
%H A399284 Chunli Li and Wenchang Chu, <a href="https://doi.org/10.3390/math12040589">Evaluating infinite series involving harmonic numbers by integration</a>, Mathematics, Vol. 12, No. 4 (2024), Article 589. See p. 20, eq. (44).
%H A399284 <a href="/index/Ha#harmonic">Index entries for sequences related to harmonic numbers</a>.
%F A399284 Equals Pi^3/32 - Pi*W/8 + 2*G*log(2), where W = A399217, and G is Catalan's constant (A006752).
%e A399284 1.196243981459176667366713849789210416906091483333319...
%t A399284 RealDigits[Pi^3/32 - Pi*HypergeometricPFQ[{1/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2}, {1, 3/2, 3/2}, 1]/8 + Catalan*Log[2], 10, 120][[1]]
%o A399284 (PARI) Pi^3/32 - Pi*hypergeom([1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2], [1,3/2,3/2], 1)/8 + Catalan*log(2)
